                <pb facs="0288" n="164" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg164"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">813.00/1162: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Honduras</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Wilson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tegucigalpa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-12-30T14:00:00-06:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 30,
                                1921—2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received January 1, 1922—9:48
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>135. Provisional Federal Council issued decrees yesterday convoking Federal
                    Deputies from the three States, and Senators from Honduras and Salvador, in
                    preparatory sessions in the first 15 days of January.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
